name: const-condition-elim
prereqs: [copy-propagation — const vars become literals first]
invariant: only fully-literal, side-effect-free conditions are
  evaluated and pruned; any condition touching a var/capture is
  untouched; a constant-true `While` is LEFT (never unrolled).
scope: offered to all (estree owner, c, go, perl, python, rust, sh,
  zig, glsl)
updates: none (first offer)
